{"stories":[{"d":"There used to be one god above them all, but the days of the Pantokrator are long gone. The very memory of his name erased from history, the backlash of his fall has eaten away most of the world, and still to this day the forces of entropy threaten its very existence. Monsters roam the land, emerging from dungeons scattered all across, stuck in a cycle of being cleared and reforming. Only the return of deities, with the blessings they confer to adventurers, allowed humankind to continue to exist, and even to thrive. But is it enough to save the future?","i":["https://cdn3.fiction.live/images/1ga13qe9s_city_of_brass_by_carloscara_d7qybf3-pre.jpg"],"likeCount":96,"ta":["fantasy","rpg","mostdicerollsbehindthescenes","notadanmachiquest","femaleprotagonist"],"cht":1790288641713,"p":72649,"isLive":true,"t":"Is it okay to accrue divinity in a dungeon?","u":[{"a":"https://cdn3.fiction.live/images/1f1vn3t4p___maria_and_pi_space_maria_drawn_by_david_liu__0f3381a28a5b7c39cb8cec01aaae5b46.jpg","_id":"GBD3f2hMx6mhHdngu","n":"magicalprincess"}],"w":1523876,"hype":1,"contentRating":"nsfw","rInteract":"medium","ut":1790456907641,"_id":"RPLW6jdhxy7ooEeiw"},{"d":"GameFuna has The Old Data again, and this time they are going to try and find out if it has any \"practical\" applications. They've injected it into the mind of an unsuspecting test subject, and as a result his world starts to become a strangely sexual video game where his deepest, most hidden desires start to come true and he begins to collect girlfriends one by one like playing cards.But as he continues to play 'the game', he starts to realize that it is fraught with danger, challenges, and potentially deadly consequences. On top of that, four 'Scrybes' are competing with each other for control and influence over the game, which gets him caught in the middle of their bickering. Will he manage to take advantage of the situation, or will he start to wish that this game had a 'uninstall' button?","i":["https